The Kimi K3 executor and CuTe DSL implementation are relocated from the official
sgl-project/sgl-nvidia-mega implementation introduced in pull request #17, with
the TP8 integration and stability updates proposed in pull request #38:
https://github.com/sgl-project/sgl-nvidia-mega/pull/38
The source snapshot is commit 459640ec1db2b0ffd5ebabc65a51dfd9524f4e44 in
LeslieWylie/sgl-nvidia-mega, not a claim that those updates were merged upstream.
Original file-level notices are retained.
SOURCE_MAPPING.json identifies every original source and its in-tree locations.

The original MlaValue implementation was written by Lee Nau in
sgl-project/sgl-nvidia-mega#17. yyihuang implemented the optional FlashInfer Cake
MLA value-gate primitive and initial SGLang adapter, incorporated separately from
the migrated payload.
https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer/pull/8867
https://github.com/YaoleWu/sglang/pull/2

